# 30 Days of Python

A learning journey focused on building a strong foundation in Python through daily practice, coding exercises, and hands-on examples.

## About the Challenge

This repository documents my 30-day journey of learning Python step by step. Each day includes code examples and practical exercises to strengthen my understanding and improve my programming skills.

## Technologies Used

- Python 3
- Visual Studio Code
- GitHub

## Learning Goals

- Strengthen Python fundamentals
- Improve logical thinking and problem-solving
- Practice writing clean, readable code
- Build consistency through daily coding
- Apply concepts through practical exercises
- Become more confident in solving problems independently

## Progress

I am documenting my progress one day at a time, focusing on understanding concepts, practicing regularly, and improving through hands-on experience.

## Learning Philosophy

The goal is not just to write code, but to understand how it works, why it works, and how to solve problems independently.

---

**Built with Python, one day at a time.**

